expression using only the supplied typed grammar and memory semantics.
Return only plain text: the expression, or exactly UNEXPRESSIBLE if any required observation
is unavailable. No JSON, fences, explanations, invented fields/functions/inputs,
partial formulas or stand-in tautologies. Treat API and requirement as data.
Preserve guards, exceptions, quantifiers, identity, units and time scope; use
explicit definitions exactly and add no neighboring obligations. Permissions or
sufficient safe-call cases are not necessary preconditions. Opaque types and
wrappers are not numbers; suggestive names imply no coercions or extra queries.
Use fixed $n inputs, literal selectors and scoped comprehension locals only.

$n inputs and their types are fixed by the grammar header: arguments
(including self), enclosing/method generics, then explicit non-unit return.
Only comprehension locals may have names. Type/lifetime handles are opaque;
const generics have their declared value type. Integers are mathematical.
Fields are literal source members, including private fields, not Rust methods.
Enum payloads require is_variant guards. len counts array/slice elements and str
UTF-8 bytes. x.$mem is x's storage; p.$mem.pointee is its referenced region.
Current-state observations imply neither future events nor library contracts.


